urname>Schneider</surname><given-names>M.F.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Caffeine-induced [Ca<sup>2</sup>+]<sub>i</sub> oscillations in neurones of frog sympathetic ganglia</article-title><source>J. Physiol.</source><volume>514</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>83</fpage><lpage>99</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9831718</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Doveetal2000"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dove</surname><given-names>L.S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nahm</surname><given-names>S.S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Murchison</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Abbott</surname><given-names>L.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Griffith</surname><given-names>W.H.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Altered calcium homeostasis in cerebellar Purkinje cells of leaner mutant mice</article-title><source>J. Neurophysiol.</source><volume>84</volume><year>2000</year><fpage>513</fpage><lpage>524</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10899223</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Emptageetal1999"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Emptage</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bliss</surname><given-names>T.V.</given-names></name><name><surname>Fine</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Single synaptic events evoke NMDA receptor-mediated release of calcium from internal stores in hippocampal dendritic spines</article-title><source>Neuron.</source><volume>22</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>115</fpage><lpage>124</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10027294</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Friel1995"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Friel</surname><given-names>D.D.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>[Ca<sup>2</sup>+]<sub>i</sub> oscillations in sympathetic neuronsan experimenta